<Slide style={{ padding: '0px' }}>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 10, background: '#0E3F8C' }} />
  <Box style={{ padding: '30px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>三、研究方法：四种信息设定 × 七种方法</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ padding: '18px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, height: 236 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 18px', gap: 6 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
          <Box style={{ background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 14, padding: '4px 14px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>甲′</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>只有数值预报</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>用 nwp 七变量：气象台提前给的预报值，电站拿不到实况。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>现报前的场景，最难的一档</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 18px', gap: 6 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
          <Box style={{ background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 14, padding: '4px 14px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>甲</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>同时刻实测</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>用 lmd 六变量：站内气象站同一个时刻的真实读数。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>有气象站的新能源场站就在这个档</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 18px', gap: 6 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
          <Box style={{ background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 14, padding: '4px 14px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>乙</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>只有历史观测</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>只用本站过去的功率和气象，配 1~24 小时滞后特征。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>气象站坏了还能不能救</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 18px', gap: 6 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
          <Box style={{ background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 14, padding: '4px 14px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>丙</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>气象 + 历史</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>两套都给，看同时刻信息到底能不能被历史补上。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>这才是工程上最现实的档</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 16, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, padding: '14px 20px', gap: 8, marginBottom: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        参加比较的共 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>5 种机器学习方法</span>：线性回归、随机森林、GBDT、LightGBM、XGBoost，外加 2 类朴素基线（上一刻功率、固定系数乘辐射）；LSTM 另作神经网络对照
      </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'center', height: 92 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 20, padding: '8px 20px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>按时间前 70% / 后 30% 切分</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 20, padding: '8px 20px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>指标统一为 %装机容量</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 20, padding: '8px 20px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>同时报 MAE 与 RMSE</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 20, padding: '8px 20px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>全部结果写进 results/ 的 CSV</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 40, bottom: 24 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>06 / 13</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
